{"event": "model_response", "time": 1793848054.0023916, "run_id": "10639db121d146fa9696d9099c6f2d6e", "seq": 18, "number": 2, "response": {"id": "0bdd1e38-dbd8-4a9c-a9b8-f75252d129a0", "object": "chat.completion", "created": 1793848052, "model": "deepseek-flash", "choices": [{"index": 0, "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "Plan the work, read the key text files, and run the baseline check.\n\n```python\nupdate_plan([\n    {\"title\": \"Read task files and run baseline pytest\", \"status\": \"doing\"},\n    {\"title\": \"Extract pages 1-52 via read_pdf and read all batches\", \"status\": \"todo\"},\n    {\"title\": \"Write five topic notes grounded in delivered evidence\", \"status\": \"todo\"},\n    {\"title\": \"Save answers and section prose, build report.json\", \"status\": \"todo\"},\n    {\"title\": \"Run pytest and submit final report\", \"status\": \"todo\"},\n])\nr = read_file(\"report.json\"); print(r[\"content\"], r[\"file_hash\"])\np = read_file(\"paper.json\"); print(p[\"content\"][:1500])\nc = run_command([\"python\", \"-m\", \"pytest\", \"-q\"]); print(c[\"rc\"]); print(c[\"stdout\"][-2000:])\n```", "reasoning_content": "Let me start by setting up a plan, reading report.json and paper.json, and running baseline pytest."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 5003, "completion_tokens": 224, "total_tokens": 5227, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4224}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 21}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4224, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 779}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
