{"event": "model_response", "time": 1793848065.397381, "run_id": "10639db121d146fa9696d9099c6f2d6e", "seq": 41, "number": 3, "response": {"id": "91ff12b9-c2c6-4f74-94cd-4a863eccd97d", "object": "chat.completion", "created": 1793848062, "model": "deepseek-flash", "choices": [{"index": 0, "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "Baseline confirmed (empty report fails structure as expected). Now extract all required pages in one call.\n\n```python\nupdate_plan([\n    {\"title\": \"Read task files and run baseline pytest\", \"status\": \"done\"},\n    {\"title\": \"Extract pages 1-52 via read_pdf and read all batches\", \"status\": \"doing\"},\n    {\"title\": \"Write five topic notes grounded in delivered evidence\", \"status\": \"todo\"},\n    {\"title\": \"Save answers and section prose, build report.json\", \"status\": \"todo\"},\n    {\"title\": \"Run pytest and submit final report\", \"status\": \"todo\"},\n])\nr = read_pdf(1, 52)\nprint(r[\"delivery\"])\nprint(r[\"evidence_ids\"][:10])\n```", "reasoning_content": "Now proceed: baseline done. Extract full range 1-52 with read_pdf once."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 5845, "completion_tokens": 181, "total_tokens": 6026, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4224}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 19}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4224, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 1621}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
