range of 4 pages might deliver 3 then pending.\n\nLet me first finish the 43-52 delivery (recall). Actually the queue says \"Continue the pending batch\" — the selector chooses the actual next batch automatically. Maybe I don't need to recall at all; just do a successful action and the next batch advances. But \"pending batch\" delivery requires recall triggering? The message says \"Queued, not delivered; the selector chooses the actual next batch.\" So calling recall with any ids triggers next batch delivery.\n\nSimplest: call recall again with remaining ids to advance.\n\nLet me do: recall with the 8 pending ids. It'll deliver next 3 (pages 43,44,45).\n\nThen repeat. That's ~3 more turns for 43-52.\n\nThen I need targeted pages for the missing facts. Pages needed:\n- overview: already have (p4-5).\n- reasoning: pages ~10-13.\n- tool_use: Toolformer tools; ToolBench API count (~p20-24).\n- multi_agent: CAMEL prompting, Generative Agents evaluators (~p25-30? CAMEL in section 4.1/4.2, Generative Agents p39-41). Generative Agents evaluator count likely p39 or p40-41.\n- outlook: Table 4 topics and conclusion (~p50-52).\n\nPages 46-52 include outcome/agenda/conclusion. Good — will be delivered.\n\nSo targeted reads needed: reasoning pages, tool_use pages, CAMEL page, and Generative Agents evaluators count (page 39-40 maybe).\n\nLet me proceed step by step. Next action: recall pending."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 9011, "completion_tokens": 1296, "total_tokens": 10307, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4352}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1157}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4352, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4659}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
