aining Data, Hallucination, Agent Behavior, Self reflection, Safety -> agenda_topics lowercase underscore: training_data, hallucination, agent_behavior, self_reflection, safety.\nshared_foundations: \"all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification\" -> reasoning, self_verification.\n\nNeed exact quotes with pages. Let's recall pages likely containing these. We need evidence ids. recall returns new ids for pages. We can queue pages 8-13, maybe 20-21, 25-27, 40-44, 51-52. But each recall batch bounded. Let's first get task_status maybe lists notes."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7205, "completion_tokens": 493, "total_tokens": 7698, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4352}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 471}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4352, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 2853}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
