election p5: initially a Google Scholar search on Agentic LLM, then a snowballing approach for cited work not in the initial set; only LLM-based approaches kept. search_methods = google_scholar_search, snowballing. Quote p5: 'The papers were initially selected with a Google Scholar search on Agentic LLM. From there, we used a snowballing approach to discover work that was cited but not yet included in our initial set.'\", 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'evidence_ids': ['ev-26c94297c50e4ef408a2', 'ev-dbca06e364385e22f3c5'], 'valid': True, 'request': 5}}, 'answers': {}, 'section_text': {}}\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 7073, "output_tokens": 57, "total_tokens": 7130}, "is_final_answer": false}}
