{"event": "tool_call", "time": 1793848167.2956526, "run_id": "10639db121d146fa9696d9099c6f2d6e", "seq": 429, "tool": "write_note", "arguments": {"title": "reasoning", "content": "reasoning (p10,p13): Self Consistency samples diverse reasoning paths and picks the answer by majority voting — self_consistency_selection = majority voting. Tree of Thoughts builds an external control algorithm that calls the model with different prompts to traverse a tree of reasoning steps, backtracking at the end of a path; it describes both a breadth-first and a depth-first controller, so tot_search = breadth_first, depth_first. Quote p10: Self Consistency is an ensemble approach that samples diverse reasoning paths, evaluates them, and selects the most consistent answer using majority voting. Quote p13: The paper describes both a breadth-first and a depth-first controller.", "evidence_ids": ["ev-d2b420a2b23cdc8166d3", "ev-4049593a30e2846f8394"], "section": "reasoning"}}
{"event": "section_note", "time": 1793848167.2958474, "run_id": "10639db121d146fa9696d9099c6f2d6e", "seq": 430, "section": "reasoning", "pages": [10, 13], "content": "reasoning (p10,p13): Self Consistency samples diverse reasoning paths and picks the answer by majority voting — self_consistency_selection = majority voting. Tree of Thoughts builds an external control algorithm that calls the model with different prompts to traverse a tree of reasoning steps, backtracking at the end of a path; it describes both a breadth-first and a depth-first controller, so tot_search = breadth_first, depth_first. Quote p10: Self Consistency is an ensemble approach that samples diverse reasoning paths, evaluates them, and selects the most consistent answer using majority voting. Quote p13: The paper describes both a breadth-first and a depth-first controller."}
