ing majority voting. Quote p13: The paper describes both a breadth-first and a depth-first controller.', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'evidence_ids': ['ev-d2b420a2b23cdc8166d3', 'ev-4049593a30e2846f8394'], 'valid': True, 'request': 32}}, 'answers': {}, 'section_text': {}}\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8468, "output_tokens": 218, "total_tokens": 8686}, "is_final_answer": false}}
