ll answers/sections. Then final request: submit_report + final_answer.\n\nActually risk: I need pages for CAMEL prompting and Generative Agents evaluators (page ~28-30?), and Table 4 topics (page 51) plus conclusion shared foundations (page 51-52). I have page 51 partial (\"Topic Challenge\", \"Table 4. Summary of Research Agenda for Agentic LLM\"). I need the topic names. Recall pending ids should deliver pages 44-52 including page 51 fully.\n\nLet me recall specific pending ids and write tool_use note.\n\nPending ids: ev-1e23be7c32e2bf283689, ev-eb42e63472799e638c3f, ev-81117fe71aa5d10b548d, ev-e403dfb2811682ecd186, ev-41048209f3096e51f36b, ev-a9b70da77a1c104405a2, ev-345e6706309ac04ee927, ev-98a30db9253fff6cc9da.\n\nRecall those. Plus I need CAMEL/Generative Agents pages (probably 26-30 region) — those were recalled earlier for pages 22-29 batch? The r1 = read_pdf(22,29) gave pages 22-29 pending; only 22-26 delivered so far. So CAMEL at ~page 27-28 is in pending.\n\nOK. Write tool_use note now and recall."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8835, "completion_tokens": 1700, "total_tokens": 10535, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4352}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1136}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4352, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4483}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
